dieđe, man vuoiŋast di lepet.« Vissa-
set dovddap mige manga have daggar
dola buollemen min vaimostæmek.
Mon jakaem, atte mi jure daina aigin,
go mi mielastæmek halidifčimek oaid-
net dam dola buollemen, maid Jesus
læ boattam cakketet ædnam ala, dovd-
